{"id":"0ab38aca0c5161bb","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md","title":"Complex Manifold","display":"df-complex-manifold — Complex Manifold","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-complex-manifold","aliases":["58-df-complex-manifold","Complex Manifold"],"display":"df-complex-manifold — Complex Manifold","depends_on":["[[58-df-atlas]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-complex-manifold"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-complex-manifold</span><span>Complex Manifold</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-complex-manifold — Complex Manifold"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d530952583f9f96d\" href=\"?note=d530952583f9f96d\" title=\"58-df-atlas\">58-df-atlas</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,\\mathcal T)\">\\((M,\\mathcal T)\\)</span> (topological space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> (complex dimension)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span> 保留上游实坐标图册编码：卡片 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\">\\(\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\subseteq\\mathbb R^{2n}\">\\(W\\subseteq\\mathbb R^{2n}\\)</span>；相应复坐标为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Realify}_{58,n}^{-1}\\circ\\phi\">\\(\\mathrm{Realify}_{58,n}^{-1}\\circ\\phi\\)</span>。不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C^n\">\\(\\mathbb C^n\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^{2n}\">\\(\\mathbb R^{2n}\\)</span> 作字面等同。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\mathcal T,2n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\mathcal T,2n)\\)</span> (real topological atlas predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d530952583f9f96d\" href=\"?note=d530952583f9f96d\" title=\"58-df-atlas\">58-df-atlas</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexLinear}_S(A,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexLinear}_S(A,n)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexDifferentiableAt}_S(g,z,U,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexDifferentiableAt}_S(g,z,U,n)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HolomorphicOnCn}_S(g,U,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{HolomorphicOnCn}_S(g,U,n)\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexAtlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\mathcal T,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexAtlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\mathcal T,n)\\)</span> (complex-chart atlas predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C^n\">\\(\\mathbb C^n\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^{2n}\">\\(\\mathbb R^{2n}\\)</span> 均采用有限函数向量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Re}\">\\(\\operatorname{Re}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Im}\">\\(\\operatorname{Im}\\)</span> 是通常复数的实部、虚部；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|z\\|=(\\sum_{i&lt;n}|z(i)|^2)^{1/2}\">\\(\\|z\\|=(\\sum_{i&lt;n}|z(i)|^2)^{1/2}\\)</span>，复向量的加法和标量乘法逐坐标定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Realify}_{58,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Realify}_{58,n}\\)</span> 由下式定义为双射函数图；其逆是反转有序对所得的关系图，复合按函数图的关系复合取实际定义域。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nn\\in\\omega\\quad\\to\\quad\\mathrm{Realify}_{58,n}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle z,x\\rangle\\in\\mathbb C^n\\times\\mathbb R^{2n}:\\forall i&lt;n\\;\n(x(2i)=\\operatorname{Re}z(i)\\land x(2i+1)=\\operatorname{Im}z(i))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nn\\in\\omega\\quad\\to\\quad\\mathrm{Realify}_{58,n}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle z,x\\rangle\\in\\mathbb C^n\\times\\mathbb R^{2n}:\\forall i&lt;n\\;\n(x(2i)=\\operatorname{Re}z(i)\\land x(2i+1)=\\operatorname{Im}z(i))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}linear}\\vdash \\mathrm{ComplexLinear}_S(A,n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(A,\\mathbb C^n,\\mathbb C^n)\\land\\forall u,v\\in\\mathbb C^n\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\left(A(u+v)=A(u)+A(v)\\land A(\\lambda u)=\\lambda A(u)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}linear}\\vdash \\mathrm{ComplexLinear}_S(A,n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(A,\\mathbb C^n,\\mathbb C^n)\\land\\forall u,v\\in\\mathbb C^n\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\left(A(u+v)=A(u)+A(v)\\land A(\\lambda u)=\\lambda A(u)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}differentiable\\text{-}at}\\vdash \\mathrm{ComplexDifferentiableAt}_S(g,z,U,n)\\leftrightarrow z\\in U\\subseteq\\mathbb C^n\\land \\mathrm{Function}(g,U,\\mathbb C^n)\\land\\exists A\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ComplexLinear}_S(A,n)\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb C^n\\;\\left(0&lt;\\lVert h\\rVert&lt;\\delta\\land z+h\\in U\\to\\lVert g(z+h)-g(z)-A(h)\\rVert\\leq\\varepsilon\\lVert h\\rVert\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}differentiable\\text{-}at}\\vdash \\mathrm{ComplexDifferentiableAt}_S(g,z,U,n)\\leftrightarrow z\\in U\\subseteq\\mathbb C^n\\land \\mathrm{Function}(g,U,\\mathbb C^n)\\land\\exists A\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ComplexLinear}_S(A,n)\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb C^n\\;\\left(0&lt;\\lVert h\\rVert&lt;\\delta\\land z+h\\in U\\to\\lVert g(z+h)-g(z)-A(h)\\rVert\\leq\\varepsilon\\lVert h\\rVert\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holomorphic\\text{-}on\\text{-}cn}\\vdash \\mathrm{HolomorphicOnCn}_S(g,U,n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(g,U,\\mathbb C^n)\\land\\forall z\\in U\\;\\mathrm{ComplexDifferentiableAt}_S(g,z,U,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holomorphic\\text{-}on\\text{-}cn}\\vdash \\mathrm{HolomorphicOnCn}_S(g,U,n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(g,U,\\mathbb C^n)\\land\\forall z\\in U\\;\\mathrm{ComplexDifferentiableAt}_S(g,z,U,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}atlas}\\vdash \\mathrm{ComplexAtlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\mathcal T,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\mathcal T,2n)\\land\\forall\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle,\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{HolomorphicOnCn}_S\\left(\\mathrm{Realify}_{58,n}^{-1}\\circ\\{\\langle\\phi(x),\\psi(x)\\rangle:x\\in U\\cap V\\}\\circ\\mathrm{Realify}_{58,n},\\mathrm{Realify}_{58,n}^{-1}[\\phi[U\\cap V]],n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}atlas}\\vdash \\mathrm{ComplexAtlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\mathcal T,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\mathcal T,2n)\\land\\forall\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle,\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{HolomorphicOnCn}_S\\left(\\mathrm{Realify}_{58,n}^{-1}\\circ\\{\\langle\\phi(x),\\psi(x)\\rangle:x\\in U\\cap V\\}\\circ\\mathrm{Realify}_{58,n},\\mathrm{Realify}_{58,n}^{-1}[\\phi[U\\cap V]],n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}manifold} \\vdash \\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S(M,\\mathcal T,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\exists\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{ComplexAtlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\mathcal T,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}manifold} \\vdash \\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S(M,\\mathcal T,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\exists\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{ComplexAtlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\mathcal T,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The transition map is required to be holomorphic only on the image of the overlap of its two chart domains.</li>\n<li>Function typing is expressed by the canonical set-function predicate rather than left as an unsourced arrow abbreviation.</li>\n<li>Almost-complex structures and the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1,0)\\oplus(0,1)\">\\((1,0)\\oplus(0,1)\\)</span> tangent decomposition are related but distinct definitions; they do not belong as extra clauses of this atom.</li>\n<li>A complex <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-manifold has underlying real dimension <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2n\">\\(2n\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Huybrechts, Complex Geometry</li>\n<li>Griffiths and Harris, Principles of Algebraic Geometry</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-atlas","status":"resolved","id":"d530952583f9f96d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-atlas]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-atlas","status":"resolved","id":"d530952583f9f96d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\mathcal T,2n)$ (real topological atlas predicate, see [[58-df-atlas]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(M,\\mathcal T)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"W\\subseteq\\mathbb R^{2n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Realify}_{58,n}^{-1}\\circ\\phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb C^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^{2n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\mathcal T,2n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComplexLinear}_S(A,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComplexDifferentiableAt}_S(g,z,U,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HolomorphicOnCn}_S(g,U,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComplexAtlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\mathcal T,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb C^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^{2n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Re}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Im}","display":false},{"tex":"\\|z\\|=(\\sum_{i<n}|z(i)|^2)^{1/2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Realify}_{58,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nn\\in\\omega\\quad\\to\\quad\\mathrm{Realify}_{58,n}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle z,x\\rangle\\in\\mathbb C^n\\times\\mathbb R^{2n}:\\forall i<n\\;\n(x(2i)=\\operatorname{Re}z(i)\\land x(2i+1)=\\operatorname{Im}z(i))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}linear}\\vdash \\mathrm{ComplexLinear}_S(A,n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(A,\\mathbb C^n,\\mathbb C^n)\\land\\forall u,v\\in\\mathbb C^n\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\left(A(u+v)=A(u)+A(v)\\land A(\\lambda u)=\\lambda A(u)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}differentiable\\text{-}at}\\vdash \\mathrm{ComplexDifferentiableAt}_S(g,z,U,n)\\leftrightarrow z\\in U\\subseteq\\mathbb C^n\\land \\mathrm{Function}(g,U,\\mathbb C^n)\\land\\exists A\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ComplexLinear}_S(A,n)\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb C^n\\;\\left(0<\\lVert h\\rVert<\\delta\\land z+h\\in U\\to\\lVert g(z+h)-g(z)-A(h)\\rVert\\leq\\varepsilon\\lVert h\\rVert\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holomorphic\\text{-}on\\text{-}cn}\\vdash \\mathrm{HolomorphicOnCn}_S(g,U,n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(g,U,\\mathbb C^n)\\land\\forall z\\in U\\;\\mathrm{ComplexDifferentiableAt}_S(g,z,U,n)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}atlas}\\vdash \\mathrm{ComplexAtlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\mathcal T,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\mathcal T,2n)\\land\\forall\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle,\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{HolomorphicOnCn}_S\\left(\\mathrm{Realify}_{58,n}^{-1}\\circ\\{\\langle\\phi(x),\\psi(x)\\rangle:x\\in U\\cap V\\}\\circ\\mathrm{Realify}_{58,n},\\mathrm{Realify}_{58,n}^{-1}[\\phi[U\\cap V]],n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}manifold} \\vdash \\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S(M,\\mathcal T,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\exists\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{ComplexAtlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\mathcal T,n)","display":true},{"tex":"(1,0)\\oplus(0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"2n","display":false}],"bytes":3924,"backlinks":[{"id":"6c6d7cb9d5ebdb5c","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S$ (complex-manifold predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md]])"},{"id":"ca89eef53dcad278","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S$ (complex-manifold predicate; see [[../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md]])"},{"id":"2754b0b2a80093e8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (complex-manifold predicate with topology and dimension, see [[../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md]])"},{"id":"2d06636b21adf739","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S$（复流形谓词，见 [[../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md]]）"},{"id":"501213b437b1373f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9edade6bb0a410c1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comple